WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:20.100
Oh, hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.101 --> 00:00:24.647
I'm a giant panda.

3
00:00:24.648 --> 00:00:29.374
Giant pandas are a type of bear.

4
00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:34.869
We're one of the rarest mammals on earth.

5
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:38.085
Where do you live?

6
00:00:38.086 --> 00:00:42.703
Giant pandas live in China.

7
00:00:42.704 --> 00:00:48.262
We like misty mountain forests.

8
00:00:48.263 --> 00:00:52.217
What do you eat?

9
00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:58.613
Giant pandas mostly eat bamboo shoots and leaves.

10
00:00:58.614 --> 00:01:03.890
We eat a lot and we eat fast.

11
00:01:03.891 --> 00:01:09.473
We eat for 12 hours a day!

12
00:01:09.474 --> 00:01:13.633
Can giant pandas climb?

13
00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:19.270
Yes, giant pandas are great climbers.

14
00:01:19.271 --> 00:01:25.070
We can also swim very well.

15
00:01:25.071 --> 00:01:27.949
Do you live alone?

16
00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:32.946
Giant pandas usually live alone.

17
00:01:32.947 --> 00:01:37.756
But sometimes we eat together.

18
00:01:37.757 --> 00:01:42.249
Do giant pandas hibernate in winter?

19
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:47.059
Most bears hibernate in winter.

20
00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:52.286
But giant pandas don't.

21
00:01:52.287 --> 00:01:58.672
We just find a warmer place for winter.

22
00:01:58.673 --> 00:02:01.578
Where do you sleep?

23
00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:07.215
Giant pandas sleep in many different places.

24
00:02:07.216 --> 00:02:17.208
Sometimes we nap in hollow logs.

25
00:02:17.209 --> 00:02:19.551
I'm hungry.

26
00:02:19.552 --> 00:02:25.261
I'm going to eat more bamboo.

27
00:02:25.262 --> 00:02:32.670
Good-bye, Giant Panda!
